          <description>Chapter Master; non-Chaos-worshipping renegade
Vephar’s Command: once per your Shooting phase one other visible friendly ABANDONED DEAD ASTARTES unit within 9" may re-roll one Hit roll (not the same die twice).</description>
        </rule>
