      <rules>
        <rule id="d63b-02c6-e44e-def1" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Battleline; occupied ground and concealment
APPROVED Ghostline Secure-and-Hold: while Hidden on an objective, one eligible model per complete five surviving squad models gains +1 OC (max +2 in 10 models), ending immediately on loss of Hidden. Sergeant Ghost-Sight. Passive Ghost-Shroud ONLY.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="d4fb4331-04ad-57ce-9464" name="Where to find weapons (v1.8)" hidden="false"><description>Open Squad Size / Personnel, then the selected size, then each named model. Five (or ten) required models and their standard weapons now populate automatically. Change each model’s Primary Weapon choice to make legal replacements; optional sixth–ninth models must be added deliberately. Equipment is charged once per selected model; do not add a second separate weapon copy.</description></rule></rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="a43b-7e9a-2f98-4067" name="Ghost-Shroud (passive; approved)" hidden="false">
          <description>Hidden detection 12" instead of 15". When exposed and not fired this or preceding turn and not Advanced/Charged, has Stealth. Does not automatically gain Hidden.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="7dc5-4748-8298-24e6" name="Ghost-Sight Sergeant Targeting Uplink (approved)" hidden="false">
          <description>Once per your Shooting phase, living Sergeant chooses one enemy visible to them. Other models in own unit re-roll ranged Hit rolls of 1 vs that unit. No illegal targeting or rerolling a die twice.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="d585-fca9-ae01-9a81" name="Secure-and-Hold (approved)" hidden="false">
          <description>While Hidden and within objective range, +1 total OC per five remaining models, maximum +2 for 10; ends immediately if unit loses Hidden, including when shooting or detected.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="025e-1ff2-66f3-58e2" name="Faction / keyword boundary" hidden="false">
