    <selectionEntry id="6127-1325-a46d-ae8e" name="Unmarked Scout Sniper Squad" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="ba96-b659-2340-9ea5" name="Specialists" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-0002" primary="true"/>
      <categoryLink id="e545-0a25-8e6c-7251" name="ASTARTES" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-a001" primary="false"/></categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="8e93-ae81-c425-491c" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="force" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="635d-8eb0-cb52-8118" name="Unmarked Scout Sniper Squad" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">6"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">4+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">1</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="99a2-7536-a539-be43" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>10th Company concealed scouting/sniper
APPROVED Infiltrators, Stealth, veteran Sergeant Ghost-Sight. Scout Recon Auspex once/Shooting phase per operator: target visible enemy within 36", give one other own sniper OR one model of different friendly ABANDONED DEAD INFANTRY within 6" ignore Stealth for ONE attack; nonstacking. No Astartes ammo or active Ghost-Shroud.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="0115-b5b1-1360-8e5b" name="Equipment Selection Note" hidden="false"><description>Longshot ammunition is fixed during army construction per equipped rifle. Recon auspex effect applies ONLY if the corresponding auspex wargear option is selected on that living model, not merely because an operator slot exists. No re-roll of a re-rolled die.</description></rule><rule id="09368130-2c91-5e4b-9776" name="Where to find weapons (v1.8)" hidden="false"><description>Open Squad Size / Personnel, then the selected size, then each named model. Five (or ten) required models and their standard weapons now populate automatically. Change each model’s Primary Weapon choice to make legal replacements; optional sixth–ninth models must be added deliberately. Equipment is charged once per selected model; do not add a second separate weapon copy.</description></rule></rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="e1de-60ce-711a-aedf" name="Ghost-Sight Veteran Scout Sergeant (approved)" hidden="false">
          <description>Once per your Shooting phase Sergeant selects one visible enemy; other models in squad re-roll ranged Hit rolls of 1 vs that enemy. Sergeant does not benefit.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="9c74-699d-5ad6-ae00" name="Unmarked Reconnaissance (approved)" hidden="false">
          <description>Infiltrators and Stealth; all models camouflage cloaks; limited Scout Recon Auspex supports ignoring Stealth on one legal attack, no extras.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="7dca-b9fa-9ccb-e3ce" name="Faction / keyword boundary" hidden="false">
          <description>FACTION: ABANDONED DEAD. BRANCH: ASTARTES. All share one catalogue. No automatic extra active Ghost-Shroud for mortals.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
