          <description>Dreadnought siege support
DRAFT Controlled Emergence: once per battle if this unit did not Advance/Charge, one of its attacks re-rolls Hit roll of 1 against designated visible enemy. Passive Ghost-Shroud only; no specialist active module.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="e5101954-c988-50d5-b753" name="Controlled Emergence" hidden="false"><description>once per battle if this unit did not Advance/Charge, one of its attacks re-rolls Hit roll of 1 against designated visible enemy. Passive Ghost-Shroud only; no specialist active module.</description></rule></rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="3064-ca01-4d04-a3e0" name="Faction / keyword boundary" hidden="false">
          <description>FACTION: ABANDONED DEAD. BRANCH: ASTARTES. All share one catalogue. No automatic extra active Ghost-Shroud for mortals.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
