    <selectionEntry id="f52f-fd8b-5791-f050" name="Silent Knell Shock Squad" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="0f33-f276-95ee-a914" name="Specialists" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-0002" primary="true"/>
      <categoryLink id="a1bd-c119-bc89-b4a4" name="ASTARTES" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-a001" primary="false"/></categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="62a9-d023-9797-e83d" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="force" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="42df-16c6-901b-6229" name="Silent Knell Shock Squad" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">6"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">3+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">1</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="eff1-eb08-6b89-986c" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>5th Company urban shock assault and direct-action specialists
DRAFT Black Bell: once per battle in your Fight phase, select an enemy unit within range of an objective marker; against it this unit may re-roll one Wound roll. Organic Sergeant has approved Ghost-Sight targeting (for eligible ranged attacks), universal passive Ghost-Shroud. Advanced module is NOT included without a separate explicit approval.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="6a33127a-1076-5813-87ef" name="Where to find weapons (v1.8)" hidden="false"><description>Open Squad Size / Personnel, then the selected size, then each named model. Five (or ten) required models and their standard weapons now populate automatically. Change each model’s Primary Weapon choice to make legal replacements; optional sixth–ninth models must be added deliberately. Equipment is charged once per selected model; do not add a second separate weapon copy.</description></rule><rule id="43fa91bf-eae6-5932-a262" name="Black Bell" hidden="false"><description>once per battle in your Fight phase, select an enemy unit within range of an objective marker; against it this unit may re-roll one Wound roll. Organic Sergeant has approved Ghost-Sight targeting (for eligible ranged attacks), universal passive Ghost-Shroud. Advanced module is NOT included without a separate explicit approval.</description></rule></rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="2a5a-11f3-963e-1f50" name="Ghost-Shroud (passive; approved)" hidden="false">
          <description>Hidden detection 12" instead of 15". When exposed and not fired this or preceding turn and not Advanced/Charged, has Stealth. Does not automatically gain Hidden.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="ded1-dd97-f5de-720f" name="Ghost-Sight Sergeant Targeting Uplink (approved)" hidden="false">
          <description>Once per your Shooting phase, living Sergeant chooses one enemy visible to them. Other models in own unit re-roll ranged Hit rolls of 1 vs that unit. No illegal targeting or rerolling a die twice.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="9066-9477-457b-0dee" name="Faction / keyword boundary" hidden="false">
          <description>FACTION: ABANDONED DEAD. BRANCH: ASTARTES. All share one catalogue. No automatic extra active Ghost-Shroud for mortals.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
