      <rules>
        <rule id="87b9-fe9f-3df1-91d9" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
1 model; M6, T3, Sv4+, W5, Ld5+, OC2. Artificer sidearm, power blade, encrypted archive keys. The Architect: once per battle, after both armies have deployed and before the first turn begins, one friendly DIRECTORATE INFANTRY unit may make a special move up to 6", obeying all normal enemy distances and terrain restrictions; it cannot use this move to automatically become Hidden. No extra Orders. Role: major named mortal leader, intelligence architect and strategic master of deception; not an Astartes.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="cf024304-d307-5436-b23f" name="The Architect" hidden="false"><description>once per battle, after both armies have deployed and before the first turn begins, one friendly DIRECTORATE INFANTRY unit may make a special move up to 6", obeying all normal enemy distances and terrain restrictions; it cannot use this move to automatically become Hidden. No extra Orders.</description></rule></rules>
