          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
1 model; M6, T3, Sv6+, W3, Ld7+, OC1. Autopistol and improvised melee weapon. Call to Rise: in your Command phase, one friendly OATHBOUND CULTISTS or LIBERATION PARTISANS unit within 6" that is not Battle-shocked gains +2 total OC until your next Command phase; never +2 OC per model and does not stack with an identical bonus. May attach to Oathbound Cultists or Partisans. Role: encourage an uprising; cannot command Directorate professionals or Astartes.</description>
