    <selectionEntry id="3ec3-f6df-6531-1bd9" name="Directorate Line Infantry" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="d93b-191f-7ca0-d6f5" name="Battleline" hidden="false" targetId="ec2c-68bb-bfbc-5ee3" primary="true"/>
      <categoryLink id="03a4-9e03-a521-9b2b" name="DIRECTORATE" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-a002" primary="false"/></categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="c1a2-217f-84f0-f766" type="max" value="6" field="selections" scope="force" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="7897-a394-4deb-8ccf" name="Directorate Line Infantry" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">6"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">5+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">2</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="1fbc-5b9d-137e-fc8e" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
10 or 20 models; M6, T3, Sv5+, W1, Ld7+, OC2. These characteristics and the three standard guns below are binding previously user-approved canon. Each ten-man element has one Sergeant and nine soldiers; a 20-model squad is two ten-man elements, not twenty models plus free officers. Sergeant equipment is an option on an existing member.

Exactly one primary per ordinary rifleman:

| Weapon | Range | A | BS | S | AP | D | Abilities |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|
| Lasrifle | 24" | 1 | 4+ | 3 | 0 | 1 | Rapid Fire 1 |
| Autogun | 24" | 2 | 4+ | 3 | 0 | 1 | — |
| Combat Shotgun | 12" | 2 | 4+ | 4 | 0 | 1 | Assault |

Easy New Recruit presets: Hold Position (lasrifles); Pressure Patrol (autoguns); Breach Escort (shotguns). Presets auto-fill default guns; the player can still change each soldier's selected weapon individually.

Special/heavy limit retained from v1.1's design decision: per ten-man element, take up to two special weapons, or one special plus one heavy, or one heavy alone; no two heavies in one ten-man element. For a twenty-man unit, apply the same cap separately to each half. Special: flamer, grenade launcher, plasma gun, meltagun. Heavy: heavy bolter, autocannon, missile launcher. An upgrade replaces the model's primary gun, does not add a model/loader and never gives two primaries.

Hold Fast: While this unit controls or contests an objective, is not Battle-shocked, and has neither Advanced nor Charged this turn, its total OC increases by 2; no per-model bonus or stacking with the same effect. Role: objective defense, occupation, and post-assault security—not a miniature Imperial Guard detachment requiring Orders.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="4aff7b3a-4740-5479-a2a4" name="Where to find weapons (v1.8)" hidden="false"><description>Open Squad Size / Personnel, then the selected size, then each named model. Five (or ten) required models and their standard weapons now populate automatically. Change each model’s Primary Weapon choice to make legal replacements; optional sixth–ninth models must be added deliberately. Equipment is charged once per selected model; do not add a second separate weapon copy.</description></rule></rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="93eb-714a-8cb4-12cc" name="Line Infantry standard guns (approved)" hidden="false">
          <description>M6" T3 Sv5+ W1 Ld7+ OC2. Each soldier one gun: Lasrifle 24" A1 BS4+ S3 AP0 D1 Rapid Fire 1; Autogun 24" A2 BS4+ S3 AP0 D1; Combat Shotgun 12" A2 BS4+ S4 AP0 D1 Assault. Nonstandard weapons are DRAFT.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="3b96-3e8f-a536-95d2" name="Faction / keyword boundary" hidden="false">
          <description>FACTION: ABANDONED DEAD. BRANCH: DIRECTORATE. All share one catalogue. No automatic extra active Ghost-Shroud for mortals.</description>
        </rule>
