    <selectionEntry id="ba71-8609-1487-aeb2" name="Directorate Veteran Cell" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="7ee2-dd6d-8dca-3786" name="Specialists" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-0002" primary="true"/>
      <categoryLink id="2284-0b79-48dc-fa00" name="DIRECTORATE" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-a002" primary="false"/></categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="bb83-670f-2035-b878" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="force" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="3704-75f9-0df4-4e30" name="Directorate Veteran Cell" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">6"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">4+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">1</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="efbb-e85f-ffd6-5153" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
5–10 models; M6, T3, Sv4+, W1, Ld6+, OC1. Hot-shot lasrifles or veteran autoguns; up to one special weapon per five. Drilled Fire: once per YOUR Shooting phase, re-roll one ranged Hit roll made by this unit. Role: elite human operators, shipboard security and precision infantry; the Chapter's equivalent of reliable veteran support, not Astartes in disguise.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="f0e052b4-6c95-5467-94dd" name="Where to find weapons (v1.8)" hidden="false"><description>Open Squad Size / Personnel, then the selected size, then each named model. Five (or ten) required models and their standard weapons now populate automatically. Change each model’s Primary Weapon choice to make legal replacements; optional sixth–ninth models must be added deliberately. Equipment is charged once per selected model; do not add a second separate weapon copy.</description></rule><rule id="48412038-45f5-5e94-b4b9" name="Drilled Fire" hidden="false"><description>once per YOUR Shooting phase, re-roll one ranged Hit roll made by this unit.</description></rule></rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="f755-dd89-3ddd-6e51" name="Faction / keyword boundary" hidden="false">
          <description>FACTION: ABANDONED DEAD. BRANCH: DIRECTORATE. All share one catalogue. No automatic extra active Ghost-Shroud for mortals.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
