    <selectionEntry id="7281-b378-4a62-560a" name="Longwatch Marksmen" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="cba0-2994-74af-70cc" name="Specialists" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-0002" primary="true"/>
      <categoryLink id="1dea-1e5b-d03b-d5de" name="DIRECTORATE" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-a002" primary="false"/></categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="e70a-5a4b-1575-008a" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="force" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="7c7e-efaf-93dd-5f51" name="Longwatch Marksmen" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">6"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">5+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">1</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="0428-c804-85fa-7eb1" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
5 models; M6, T3, Sv5+, W1, Ld7+, OC1. Five human sniper rifles: Range 36", A1, BS4+, S4, AP-1, D2, Heavy, Precision. Patient Shot: if the unit did not move this turn, one model may re-roll one Wound roll of 1 in your Shooting phase. Role: mortal marksmen, clearly weaker than both the approved Scout Precision Rifle (BS3+) and Astartes Longshot (S6/AP-2/D3). They never receive Astartes sniper ammunition or Ghost-Eye upgrades merely because they share the Chapter keyword.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="04aa44f9-bea8-5901-84fe" name="Where to find weapons (v1.8)" hidden="false"><description>Open Squad Size / Personnel, then the selected size, then each named model. Five (or ten) required models and their standard weapons now populate automatically. Change each model’s Primary Weapon choice to make legal replacements; optional sixth–ninth models must be added deliberately. Equipment is charged once per selected model; do not add a second separate weapon copy.</description></rule><rule id="2f3ae669-b3f4-5734-be09" name="Patient Shot" hidden="false"><description>if the unit did not move this turn, one model may re-roll one Wound roll of 1 in your Shooting phase.</description></rule></rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="234b-1c24-8538-2f06" name="Faction / keyword boundary" hidden="false">
          <description>FACTION: ABANDONED DEAD. BRANCH: DIRECTORATE. All share one catalogue. No automatic extra active Ghost-Shroud for mortals.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="2c32-35b2-2192-eb97" name="Squad Size / Personnel" hidden="false" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="392c-3892-6606-d478">
          <constraints>
