    <selectionEntry id="4dd9-b81c-4ccf-5a25" name="Heavy Weapons Cell" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="b8f2-6345-f963-9e6c" name="Vehicles &amp; Support" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-0003" primary="true"/>
      <categoryLink id="2056-b9fa-611e-65a6" name="DIRECTORATE" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-a002" primary="false"/></categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="bdc0-4a24-8baa-f593" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="force" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="4fba-5b96-86cb-7ae9" name="Heavy Weapons Cell" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">4"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">5+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">1</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="6fa7-8323-6d77-78f1" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
3 crew-team models; M4, T3, Sv5+, W2 per team-model, Ld7+, OC1. Each team-model represents two humans in the lore, but counts as one tabletop model and two transport spaces; do not add free loader models. Each team chooses exactly one heavy bolter, autocannon, missile launcher, lascannon or mortar. Emplaced Fire: if the unit did not move, once per Shooting phase one team may re-roll one Hit roll of 1. Role: one familiar heavy-weapons choice with configurable gun teams, not separate redundant mortar/lascannon/anti-tank units.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="3e7c3e6c-9e52-5b9c-8fc0" name="Where to find weapons (v1.8)" hidden="false"><description>Open Squad Size / Personnel, then the selected size, then each named model. Five (or ten) required models and their standard weapons now populate automatically. Change each model’s Primary Weapon choice to make legal replacements; optional sixth–ninth models must be added deliberately. Equipment is charged once per selected model; do not add a second separate weapon copy.</description></rule><rule id="b4eb0863-004d-5039-baf0" name="Emplaced Fire" hidden="false"><description>if the unit did not move, once per Shooting phase one team may re-roll one Hit roll of 1.</description></rule></rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="72f5-0adc-bdf3-550d" name="Faction / keyword boundary" hidden="false">
          <description>FACTION: ABANDONED DEAD. BRANCH: DIRECTORATE. All share one catalogue. No automatic extra active Ghost-Shroud for mortals.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="760d-d8b6-ed3e-0d9b" name="Squad Size / Personnel" hidden="false" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="c230-2481-3f2f-8497">
