      <rules>
        <rule id="759f-1e60-cedd-48a9" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
3 models; M6, T3, Sv5+, W1, Ld7+, OC1. Sidearms and support gear. Choose one mission kit when building the roster:

- Medicae: once per battle at the end of your Movement phase, restore one destroyed non-Character, non-crew model to one nearby friendly Directorate Infantry unit within 3", not exceeding its starting strength. No cultists/Astartes.
- Forge: at the end of your Movement phase, one friendly Directorate Vehicle within 3" regains D3 lost Wounds, with a strict one repair effect per vehicle per turn limit; cannot return a destroyed vehicle.

Role: folds medics, technical experts, and field recovery personnel into one supporting unit. Recovery Crawlers remain available as narrative assets or scenario-specific variants, not a redundant compulsory datasheet.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="3c78de8b-41b0-5896-b31a" name="Where to find weapons (v1.8)" hidden="false"><description>Open Squad Size / Personnel, then the selected size, then each named model. Five (or ten) required models and their standard weapons now populate automatically. Change each model’s Primary Weapon choice to make legal replacements; optional sixth–ninth models must be added deliberately. Equipment is charged once per selected model; do not add a second separate weapon copy.</description></rule></rules>
