      <rules>
        <rule id="6890-cbe2-736c-9a0d" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
10 or 20 models; M6, T3, Sv6+, W1, Ld8+, OC1. Choose improvised pistols and knives or basic scavenged autoguns per cultist; one flamer or heavy stubber per ten, replacing one primary weapon. Hidden in Plain Sight: while wholly in qualifying terrain and not having shot in the current turn, this unit has Stealth, but does not automatically become Hidden. Role: disposable fronts, demonstrations, diversionary uprisings. Separate from disciplined Directorate troops; not inherently Chaos-aligned.
Separate CULTIST sub-role. Does not inherit Directorate professional skills or Astartes Ghost-Shroud.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="b18ca15b-1eae-5a45-80bb" name="Where to find weapons (v1.8)" hidden="false"><description>Open Squad Size / Personnel, then the selected size, then each named model. Five (or ten) required models and their standard weapons now populate automatically. Change each model’s Primary Weapon choice to make legal replacements; optional sixth–ninth models must be added deliberately. Equipment is charged once per selected model; do not add a second separate weapon copy.</description></rule><rule id="18d88ad1-aece-557a-b489" name="Hidden in Plain Sight" hidden="false"><description>while wholly in qualifying terrain and not having shot in the current turn, this unit has Stealth, but does not automatically become Hidden.</description></rule></rules>
      <rules>
