    <selectionEntry id="b2d2-bf41-7500-1203" name="Shroud-Knife Cultists" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="64d3-fdeb-71ea-f04e" name="Specialists" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-0002" primary="true"/>
      <categoryLink id="a140-947e-39ce-755b" name="CULTISTS" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-a003" primary="false"/></categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="bee3-72ad-3497-c4ab" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="force" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="9957-2a1c-93b2-517f" name="Shroud-Knife Cultists" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">6"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">8+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">1</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="9fe5-6729-d36e-efb0" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
5–10 models; M6, T3, Sv6+, W1, Ld8+, OC1. Pistols, ritual knives and hidden improvised charges. Infiltrators, but never deploy within 12" of an opponent's deployment zone. Knife in the Dark: in each Fight phase, re-roll one melee Hit roll made by this unit against a target wholly in terrain. Role: cultist ambush and disruption; no daemon summons or professional Directorate Orders.
Separate CULTIST sub-role. Does not inherit Directorate professional skills or Astartes Ghost-Shroud.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="fbb2e546-25e3-5106-a524" name="Where to find weapons (v1.8)" hidden="false"><description>Open Squad Size / Personnel, then the selected size, then each named model. Five (or ten) required models and their standard weapons now populate automatically. Change each model’s Primary Weapon choice to make legal replacements; optional sixth–ninth models must be added deliberately. Equipment is charged once per selected model; do not add a second separate weapon copy.</description></rule><rule id="77475c6b-231b-5b81-992a" name="Knife in the Dark" hidden="false"><description>in each Fight phase, re-roll one melee Hit roll made by this unit against a target wholly in terrain.</description></rule></rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="79dc-ec7e-52a8-e90c" name="Faction / keyword boundary" hidden="false">
          <description>FACTION: ABANDONED DEAD. BRANCH: CULTIST. All share one catalogue. No automatic extra active Ghost-Shroud for mortals.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
