    <selectionEntry id="d965-5dd1-c8f4-14f7" name="Liberation Partisans" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="d32a-e844-64c2-6719" name="Battleline" hidden="false" targetId="ec2c-68bb-bfbc-5ee3" primary="true"/>
      <categoryLink id="3bdf-09b0-feda-627d" name="DIRECTORATE" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-a002" primary="false"/></categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="b524-3457-0a0b-7225" type="max" value="6" field="selections" scope="force" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="b458-d982-edc0-7a83" name="Liberation Partisans" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">6"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">1</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="7cdb-348c-8531-17f4" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
10 or 20 models; M6, T3, Sv6+, W1, Ld7+, OC1. Mixed lasrifles, autoguns or shotguns; one Directorate-style special weapon per ten. Local Guides: Scouts 6"; does not gain Infiltrators at the same time through this rule. Role: community defenders, defectors, armed underground and rescued garrisons. More reliable than cult mobs but not professional Directorate regulars.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="9827d3bf-387d-5f6f-a1bf" name="Where to find weapons (v1.8)" hidden="false"><description>Open Squad Size / Personnel, then the selected size, then each named model. Five (or ten) required models and their standard weapons now populate automatically. Change each model’s Primary Weapon choice to make legal replacements; optional sixth–ninth models must be added deliberately. Equipment is charged once per selected model; do not add a second separate weapon copy.</description></rule><rule id="98cb66c3-1283-5722-9560" name="Local Guides" hidden="false"><description>Scouts 6"; does not gain Infiltrators at the same time through this rule.</description></rule></rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="09be-3cc1-6e4b-c1da" name="Faction / keyword boundary" hidden="false">
          <description>FACTION: ABANDONED DEAD. BRANCH: DIRECTORATE. All share one catalogue. No automatic extra active Ghost-Shroud for mortals.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
