    <selectionEntry id="ca59-3db2-b206-af6c" name="Ghost Carrier" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="f115-da3f-301e-a1e6" name="Vehicles &amp; Support" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-0003" primary="true"/>
      <categoryLink id="769e-696e-e030-cddb" name="DIRECTORATE" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-a002" primary="false"/></categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="e5b5-54c6-e320-9dff" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="force" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile id="7218-dee8-7dcb-2af8" name="Ghost Carrier" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">12"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">3+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">11</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">2</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="a332-0d3a-bf50-60e8" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
1 vehicle; M12, T9, Sv3+, W11, Ld7+, OC2. Transport 12 DIRECTORATE INFANTRY models, with the usual restrictions; attached Leaders use space. Standard turret: multilaser or heavy bolter. One optional pintle gun. Choose one fit:

- Covered Transport (default): normal transport, no special movement rule.
- Recon Fit (+5 provisional): gains Scouts 6" only if empty or if every passenger, including attached Leaders, possesses Scouts; otherwise it cannot perform a Scouts move. Passenger capacity unchanged.
- Fire Support Fit (+15 provisional): replaces the standard turret with a vehicle autocannon and reduces transport capacity to 10. Once per turn after one unit disembarks during your Movement phase, it may re-roll one ranged Hit roll in the same turn's Shooting phase.
- Recovery Fit (+5 provisional): transport capacity becomes 0; replace turret with a heavy flamer or heavy stubber, and gain Recovery Gantry: at the end of your Movement phase, one nearby friendly DIRECTORATE VEHICLE within 3" regains 1 lost Wound; no vehicle may benefit from more than one repair source per turn. Does not resurrect a destroyed vehicle.

Role: folds patrol carriers, armored carriers, IFVs and recovery crawlers into a single familiar transport/support chassis datasheet. It does not automatically carry Astartes or cultists. If Recon/Fire Support fit isn't selected, use default only; these are mutually exclusive.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
