      <rules>
        <rule id="404b-53a4-339c-4623" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
1–3 walkers; each M10, T7, Sv3+, W7, Ld7+, OC2. Choose one weapon per walker: autocannon, multilaser or missile launcher. Scouts 6". Role: light pursuit, reconnaissance and mobile heavy support. Weapon swaps never produce a second primary turret.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="e79d896f-f8cd-508f-a7ba" name="Where to find weapons (v1.8)" hidden="false"><description>Open Squad Size / Personnel, then the selected size, then each named model. Five (or ten) required models and their standard weapons now populate automatically. Change each model’s Primary Weapon choice to make legal replacements; optional sixth–ninth models must be added deliberately. Equipment is charged once per selected model; do not add a second separate weapon copy.</description></rule></rules>
      <rules>
        <rule id="e26a-cacd-4a7b-2bc6" name="Faction / keyword boundary" hidden="false">
