      <rules>
        <rule id="bc66-419f-3c41-edc0" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
1 vehicle; M10, T11, Sv2+, W13, Ld7+, OC3. One turret package, one hull gun, optional sponsons if priced. All use the same chassis profile—do not make three separate almost-identical datasheets:

- Breaker Cannon (base 160): Battle Cannon, 48", D6+3, BS4+, S10, AP-2, D3, Blast.
- Hunter Cannon (+10): Tank Destroyer Cannon, 48", A2, BS4+, S12, AP-3, D6+1; Armor Hunter: one Wound roll of 1 may be re-rolled against Vehicle/Monster each Shooting phase.
- Siege Cannon (+20): Demolition Cannon, 24", D6+3, BS4+, S12, AP-2, D3, Blast; once per Shooting phase, when attacking an enemy wholly within terrain, one turret attack gains +1 Strength (not AP or Damage).

Role: reclaimed and modified armor for planned strikes and consolidation, not an entire parade of unrelated Imperial Guard tank datasheets.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <rules>
