          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
1 mobile platform; M8, T9, Sv3+, W10, Ld7+, OC2. Choose exactly one payload; no extra artillery platform for a different gun:

- Siege Support (base): long-range siege cannon, 72", D6+1, BS4+, S10, AP-2, D3, Blast, Indirect Fire.
- Saturation (+0): multiple-rocket pod, 60", 2D6, BS4+, S6, AP-1, D1, Blast, Indirect Fire.
- Mortar Screen (-5): mortar rack, 48", 2D6, BS4+, S5, AP0, D1, Blast, Indirect Fire.
- Air Denial (-25): anti-air twin autocannon, 48", A4, BS4+, S9, AP-1, D3, Anti-Fly 4+ against FLY targets. No Indirect Fire.

Role: siege, screening or denying airspace. Crew and ammunition are in the existing platform; no hidden additional squad requirements.</description>
        </rule>
