        <rule id="603b-ed26-9e6b-f8f2" name="Unit rules / draft status" hidden="false">
          <description>Playtest mortal datasheet. No mandatory Guard-style officer Orders. This unit and all Astartes units belong to ONE Abandoned Dead faction.
1 aircraft/fly platform; provisional M20, T9, Sv3+, W11, Ld7+, OC2. Two mutually exclusive mission kits:

- Extraction/Airlift (160): Transport 10 DIRECTORATE INFANTRY models; nose autocannon and rocket pods.
- Strike Sortie (+10): No transport capacity; heavy autocannon and missile payload. Once per battle, re-roll one Wound roll against a legally visible target in weapon range.

Role: rare precision transport or support sortie; use the correct aircraft movement and mission restrictions of the active game system before playtesting. No free stacking aircraft movement rules.

---</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="ca18-adaa-85b8-ac30" name="Mission Kit / Deployment Protocol" hidden="false" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="0ce5-e265-ef9f-d4a9">
