ek Soln is the permanent Captain of the 7th — Phantom Lancers; Ghost Spear is his cover identity, NOT a separate selectable character. Equipment and ability are PLAYTEST drafts except established identity and command.</description></rule><rule id="8e5f-8f2a-c214-7b1a" name="Legal Leader Attachments (manual validation)" hidden="false"><description>Mounted command-biker. May attach only to Phantom Lancers; cannot join foot Ghostline squads. One attached Leader per unit; associations currently require manual verification.</description></rule><rule id="bb65-ab5e-1303-740b" name="Concealed Spearhead (PROVISIONAL)" hidden="false"><description>Once per battle in your Movement phase, one friendly ABANDONED DEAD VEHICLE within 6 inches may re-roll its Advance roll.</description></rule><rule id="e92e-0018-15bc-9306" name="Ghost-Shroud (passive)" hidden="false"><description>Astartes passive Ghost-Shroud: when Hidden, detection threshold 12 inches instead of 15. When exposed and not fired this or preceding turn and not Advanced/Charged this turn, benefits from Stealth; no automatic Hidden.</description></rule><rule id="b006-9420-7615-204c" name="Ghost Spear Command Bike" hidden="false"><description>Fixed wargear: command bike; M12 inches/T5 profile represents mounted status. Mounted for the entire battle, not a selectable foot version.</description></rule></rules><selectionEntryGroups/></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="b85f-173a-ff5a-bb13" name="Maelor Vexis, Nightfall" hidden="false" collective="false" type="unit" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="d9bf-b3f0-967b-c03b" name="Command" hidden="false" targetId="b411-6717-d966-5c6d" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="e9ff-b21f-0361-ec0c" name="ASTARTES" hidden="false" targetId="adbd-c48e-4b21-a001" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><constraints><constraint id="5bff-dca1-bcbb-b9e0" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/></constrai